Local development startup notes

Read README.md for prerequisites, environment setup, dependency installation,
and full run instructions.

Start MongoDB, then open three terminals from the project root:

1. AI service: cd ai-server; activate its .venv (.\venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1); python ai_server.py
2. API: cd server; node server.js
3. Frontend: cd client; npm run dev

Configure server/.env and ai-server/.env from their .env.example files.
Never put API keys or other secrets in this file or commit local .env files.
